{
  "Script": "Story/AC42/Day03/Novel/AC42_03_10_00",
  "Entries": [
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01192_CReaper",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "We're gonna make da ultimate kari together!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01193_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Eh?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01194_CReaper",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "We're gonna make da ult—",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01195_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "No, I heard you properly. But how do you know about the ultimate kari?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01196_IRedmayne",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Well, remember how we said Yotsuha told us about your feelings?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01197_LShanhua",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "She told us about the ultimate kari, too.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01198_MdAngelis",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "It is very important, yes?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01199_CSkopovskaya",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "You will let us help with ultimate kari too?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01201_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Would you...?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01204_CReaper",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Yes! Alright, let's cook up some ultimate kari!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Z_906800076_LShanhua",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "But how do we go about making it?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Z_906800077_CReaper",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Well... Go on, Vritika, lead the way!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Z_906800078_LShanhua",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "You are dumping all the responsibility on her after all!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Z_906800079_IRedmayne",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Well, that's because we can't even manage to make kari of any variety, let alone the ultimate one.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Z_906800080_CSkopovskaya",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "But cooking together, is sounding fun.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Z_906800081_MdAngelis",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Yes... It brings back memories of making pizza with the sisters.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01206_CReaper",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Vritika? What's up?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Z_906800082_LShanhua",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "No doubt, she is calculating the right roles for us, for maximum efficiency.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Z_906800083_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "No. I was not calculating.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Z_906800084_LShanhua",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "So you were just spacing out?!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Z_906800085_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "But...I think I have my answer now.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01207_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "There is an overall order in how to prepare it, but we do not need to follow any recipe too closely.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01208_MdAngelis",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "So we can cook however we want.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01209_IRedmayne",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "I didn't know what the right ingredients were, so I brought a little bit of what everyone likes. Is that alright?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01210_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "That is fine. Kanata and the others already gathered the spices we will need.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01211_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Let us create the ultimate kari together. A collaborative work for 31-X.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01212_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "First, could you chop these ingredients and spices? I will leave the size of the cuts to your discretion.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01213_MdAngelis",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "I will do this.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Context": "Adv.bubbleSeActNoWait:0",
      "Original": "*chop chop chop*",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01214_VBalakrishnanMother",
      "Context": "Adv.talkAllIn:0",
      "Original": "Punarvi Balakrishnan",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01214_VBalakrishnanMother",
      "Context": "Adv.talkAllIn:1",
      "Original": "Punarvi Balakrishnan",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01214_VBalakrishnanMother",
      "Context": "Adv.talkAllIn:2",
      "Original": "Alright, Sharmila, you're in charge of chopping veggies.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01215_VBalakrishnanMother",
      "Context": "Adv.talkAllIn:0",
      "Original": "Punarvi Balakrishnan",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01215_VBalakrishnanMother",
      "Context": "Adv.talkAllIn:1",
      "Original": "Punarvi Balakrishnan",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01215_VBalakrishnanMother",
      "Context": "Adv.talkAllIn:2",
      "Original": "Cut them to whatever size you like, so long as you like it!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Z_906800086_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkAllIn:1",
      "Original": "Vritika Balakrishnan",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Z_906800086_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkAllIn:2",
      "Original": "Can I help?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Z_906800087_VBalakrishnanMother",
      "Context": "Adv.talkAllIn:0",
      "Original": "Punarvi Balakrishnan",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Z_906800087_VBalakrishnanMother",
      "Context": "Adv.talkAllIn:1",
      "Original": "Punarvi Balakrishnan",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Z_906800087_VBalakrishnanMother",
      "Context": "Adv.talkAllIn:2",
      "Original": "Vritika, you help your sister. Put the ingredients into a bowl. And be very careful how you handle that knife.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Z_906800088_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkAllIn:1",
      "Original": "Vritika Balakrishnan",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Z_906800088_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkAllIn:2",
      "Original": "I will. Mmh.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01216_MdAngelis",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "It is ready.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01217_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "My my... You nearly cut it into powder. But we can go with this.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01218_IRedmayne",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "This is actually acceptable?!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01220_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Next, let us heat some oil in the pot and start roasting the spices.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01221_LShanhua",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Frying, is it? Then allow me!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01222_IRedmayne",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithIcon:1",
      "Original": "Isn't that too much oil?! There's flames rising out of the pan!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01223_VBalakrishnanFather",
      "Context": "Adv.talkAllIn:0",
      "Original": "Maganir Balakrishnan",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01223_VBalakrishnanFather",
      "Context": "Adv.talkAllIn:1",
      "Original": "Maganir Balakrishnan",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01223_VBalakrishnanFather",
      "Context": "Adv.talkAllIn:2",
      "Original": "Ow, it's hot! H-Hey! Isn't the fire too big?!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01224_VBalakrishnanMother",
      "Context": "Adv.talkAllIn:0",
      "Original": "Punarvi Balakrishnan",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01224_VBalakrishnanMother",
      "Context": "Adv.talkAllIn:1",
      "Original": "Punarvi Balakrishnan",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01224_VBalakrishnanMother",
      "Context": "Adv.talkAllIn:2",
      "Original": "Don't worry about it! Firepower is justice!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01225_VBalakrishnanFather",
      "Context": "Adv.talkAllIn:0",
      "Original": "Maganir Balakrishnan",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01225_VBalakrishnanFather",
      "Context": "Adv.talkAllIn:1",
      "Original": "Maganir Balakrishnan",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01225_VBalakrishnanFather",
      "Context": "Adv.talkAllIn:2",
      "Original": "B-But... Whoa! There's fire coming out of the pot!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Z_906800089_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkAllIn:1",
      "Original": "Vritika Balakrishnan",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Z_906800089_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkAllIn:2",
      "Original": "Assuming the temperature of the oil is <i>t</i>, and the intensity of the fire is <i>p</i>, the surface temperature required for the pot to produce flames is...",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Z_906800090_VBalakrishnanFather",
      "Context": "Adv.talkAllIn:0",
      "Original": "Maganir Balakrishnan",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Z_906800090_VBalakrishnanFather",
      "Context": "Adv.talkAllIn:1",
      "Original": "Maganir Balakrishnan",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Z_906800090_VBalakrishnanFather",
      "Context": "Adv.talkAllIn:2",
      "Original": "Vritika's started doing numbers in her head again! Deepak, that's dangerous, let go!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01226_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "No, this is just right. Otherwise, ingredients we put in later won't cook as well.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01227_LShanhua",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Garlic, ginger... And then add in onions... Good!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01228_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "And then the meat...",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01229_CSkopovskaya",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "I bring plenty. We use all.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Z_906800091_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkAllIn:1",
      "Original": "Vritika Balakrishnan",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Z_906800091_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkAllIn:2",
      "Original": "Look at all the meat Vijay got us!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01230_VBalakrishnanMother",
      "Context": "Adv.talkAllIn:0",
      "Original": "Punarvi Balakrishnan",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01230_VBalakrishnanMother",
      "Context": "Adv.talkAllIn:1",
      "Original": "Punarvi Balakrishnan",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01230_VBalakrishnanMother",
      "Context": "Adv.talkAllIn:2",
      "Original": "I know you're a big eater, but that's way too much meat!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01231_VBalakrishnanMother",
      "Context": "Adv.talkAllIn:0",
      "Original": "Punarvi Balakrishnan",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01231_VBalakrishnanMother",
      "Context": "Adv.talkAllIn:1",
      "Original": "Punarvi Balakrishnan",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01231_VBalakrishnanMother",
      "Context": "Adv.talkAllIn:2",
      "Original": "It's fine! Dump it all in!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01232_CReaper",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Isn't this too much?! How many mouths are we feeding here?!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01233_CSkopovskaya",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "We eat together, then I share with Ruka... Ruka is happy to get lots of meat...",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01234_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Good idea. Let us dump it all in.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01235_IRedmayne",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Ooohoo?! Now it smells like meat in here!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01236_CReaper",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Let's cancel it out with some good ol' ketchup! That should go well with meat!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01237_MdAngelis",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Add this, too. I made this tomato sauce for pizza.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01238_VBalakrishnanFather",
      "Context": "Adv.talkAllIn:0",
      "Original": "Maganir Balakrishnan",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01238_VBalakrishnanFather",
      "Context": "Adv.talkAllIn:1",
      "Original": "Maganir Balakrishnan",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01238_VBalakrishnanFather",
      "Context": "Adv.talkAllIn:2",
      "Original": "Chocolate and raisins... Honey too? Isn't it going to make the flavor all wonky?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01239_VBalakrishnanMother",
      "Context": "Adv.talkAllIn:1",
      "Original": "Punarvi Balakrishnan",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01239_VBalakrishnanMother",
      "Context": "Adv.talkAllIn:2",
      "Original": "Sharmila loves chocolate, Vijay loves raisins, and Deepak loves honey.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01240_VBalakrishnanFather",
      "Context": "Adv.talkAllIn:0",
      "Original": "Maganir Balakrishnan",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01240_VBalakrishnanFather",
      "Context": "Adv.talkAllIn:1",
      "Original": "Maganir Balakrishnan",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01240_VBalakrishnanFather",
      "Context": "Adv.talkAllIn:2",
      "Original": "And what about Vritika's favorite?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01241_VBalakrishnanMother",
      "Context": "Adv.talkAllIn:1",
      "Original": "Punarvi Balakrishnan",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01241_VBalakrishnanMother",
      "Context": "Adv.talkAllIn:2",
      "Original": "Can't you see what we're cooking right now?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Z_906800092_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkAllIn:1",
      "Original": "Vritika Balakrishnan",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Z_906800092_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkAllIn:2",
      "Original": "Mhm!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01242_LShanhua",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Wait, should we really just dump anything in?!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01243_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "It is fine. We could sprinkle in twice as many spices and it would work out.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01244_IRedmayne",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "What are you talking about?! I thought you were a lot more particular about measurements!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01245_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "It is fine. After all, this is the ultimate kari.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01246_CSkopovskaya",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "This is very fun... I should put in crushed grechka, too.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01247_LShanhua",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "I fried the meat... There was so much my arms are aching...",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01248_CSkopovskaya",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Are you going to add something, Yingxia?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01249_LShanhua",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Yes, hmm... I'll add in some ba jiao, then! That is a spice for Chinese cooking, if there ever was one.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01250_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "It is star anise, yes? Then add it with the other spices and pour the water in.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01251_IRedmayne",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Wow... Now I feel like adding something in, too! There!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01252_LShanhua",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "H-Hey! What did you add?!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01253_IRedmayne",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "...An eel. And I don't mean jelly, of course.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01254_CReaper",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Oh... Eel...",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01255_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Heheh, I look forward to see how it turns out.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01256_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "It is prepared. Let us hurry up and serve it.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01257_LShanhua",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Ooh... It smells completely unlike what we had this morning.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01258_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Everyone, if you would please?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01259_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.bubbleTalkAsync:1",
      "Original": "Thank you for the food.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01260_CReaper",
      "Context": "Adv.bubbleTalkAsync:1",
      "Original": "Thank you for da food!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01262_IRedmayne",
      "Context": "Adv.bubbleTalkAsync:1",
      "Original": "Thank you for the food.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01264_CSkopovskaya",
      "Context": "Adv.bubbleTalkAsync:1",
      "Original": "Thanks for food.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01263_MdAngelis",
      "Context": "Adv.bubbleTalkAsync:1",
      "Original": "Thank you for the food.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01261_LShanhua",
      "Context": "Adv.bubbleTalkAsync:1",
      "Original": "Thank you for the food.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01268_IRedmayne",
      "Context": "Adv.bubbleAngerAsync:1",
      "Original": "Eew?!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01269_CSkopovskaya",
      "Context": "Adv.bubbleTalkAsync:1",
      "Original": "Bad taste...",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01267_MdAngelis",
      "Context": "Adv.bubbleTalkAsync:1",
      "Original": "Mmgh...",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01265_CReaper",
      "Context": "Adv.bubbleAngerAsync:1",
      "Original": "It's gross!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01266_LShanhua",
      "Context": "Adv.bubbleAngerAsync:1",
      "Original": "Yuck!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01270_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "...Heh. Heheheh!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01271_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacialInMonolog:3",
      "Original": "(Oh, yes... This is it...)",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01272_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacialInMonolog:3",
      "Original": "(The first time I had the ultimate kari, it tasted quite bad, just like this.)",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01273_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacialInMonolog:3",
      "Original": "(But seeing my father and my siblings eat it with such joy made me think it was the tastiest kari in the world.)",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01274_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacialInMonolog:3",
      "Original": "(The ultimate kari I was trying to achieve all this time was my memory of the result it created.)",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01275_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacialInMonolog:3",
      "Original": "(But that was never it, was it, Mother?)",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01276_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacialInMonolog:3",
      "Original": "(The real answer to the ultimate kari...is in the process of making it.)",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Z_907400197_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacialInMonolog:3",
      "Original": "(I finally found it... The ultimate kari is the kari we all make together.)",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01277_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "It tastes...bad, does it not...?!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01278_CReaper",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Oh, why are you laughin'? Heheh. Not that I don't relate!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01279_IRedmayne",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Ahahaha! We just dumped stuff into a pot, so of course it's going to taste like chaos!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01280_MdAngelis",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "An absolutely disgusting flavor, without a hint of harmony. But... Hah, it is...quite funny.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01281_CSkopovskaya",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Heheh... I cannot give Ruka this. This is 31-X kari... Kari only 31-X can enjoy.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01282_LShanhua",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Hahah, and we had to cook such a big pot, too. How are we going to get rid of this?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01283_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Do not worry. We can improve it so it becomes more edible.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01284_CReaper",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Heheh, dat sounds pretty fun, too!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01285_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Yes...I think it will be a lot of fun. And we can keep sharing the fun this way.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01286_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "This is...the ultimate kari I was looking for!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01287_CReaper",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Ahaha... That's silly. But honestly, it's a wonderful kinda stupid silly!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01288_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacialInMonolog:3",
      "Original": "(Everyone was so divided, but now we are seated at the same table, laughing...)",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01289_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacialInMonolog:3",
      "Original": "(This is the dinner table Mother always showed me. The dinner table I loved so much.)",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Z_907400198_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacialInMonolog:3",
      "Original": "(The scene I thought I lost, that I wished to see just one more time...)",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01290_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "H-Huh...?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01291_CReaper",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Vritika...?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01292_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "I'm sorry... The tears just keep flowing...",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01293_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "*sniffle...* I'm sorry... They just...do not stop...",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01294_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "It is...strange. I am happy so...why am I crying?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01295_CReaper",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Nothin' strange about it. Sometimes, happiness brings you to tears.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01296_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Carole...",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01297_CReaper",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "I never knew you was thinkin' these kindsa thoughts in that head of yours. You're always so calm n' collected. Well, 'cept for when you get all heated about kari...",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01298_CReaper",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "But ya got me, team leader, beat when it comes to carin' about 31-X's bonds. And ya act on it, too...",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Z_907200166_CReaper",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "So, as team leader, I accept your feelings, Vritika! I won't lose sight of 'em ever again.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Z_907400108_MdAngelis",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "31-X is a group of women from different backgrounds and attitudes, but you proved we can come together to fight. Color me impressed, Vritika.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Z_907200134_LShanhua",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Now that you have made 31-X's bonds tighter, I, as tactician, can guide us to new heights. Know that your devotion was not in vain!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Z_907200116_IRedmayne",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "It's not just about how we fight, either. You showed us the right way to spend time together as friends who live side-by-side.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01299_CSkopovskaya",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Wanting to see precious comrades always smiling... I understand your feeling, Vritika...",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01300_LShanhua",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "I daresay you're too taciturn. You should speak your mind more often.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01301_IRedmayne",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "That's true... We have words so we can express ourselves, you know.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01302_MdAngelis",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "I acknowledge I am not one for words myself...but you take it to another level.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01303_CReaper",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Say, gals, I got an idea!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01304_CReaper",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "How about we try makin' kari together again sometime? Sure, we won't always get to do it, what with missions n' all, but we oughta get together when we can!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Z_907200167_CReaper",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "So's we'll never forget those 31-X bonds Vritika worked so hard to forge!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Z_907200135_LShanhua",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Mhm, if we wish to strengthen 31-X's coordination, we must deepen our bonds!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Z_907400109_MdAngelis",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "No objection.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Z_907200117_IRedmayne",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Everyone's trying to put a spin on it, but you're all just saying that today was a lot of fun, and we should do it again. Be more sincere, would you?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Z_907600004_Cskopovskaya",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Making 31-X kari is fun.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_Z_907200168_CReaper",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Yes! Vritika, gals! Let's figure out the next kari we're gonna make!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01305_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Yes. I am sure the ultimate kari will taste even better next time.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_01306_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Let us find the right recipe, together.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    }
  ],
  "Inserts": []
}